cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  If you use pymatgen in your research, please cite the paper in the
  preferred-citation field below. The original pymatgen paper is also
  listed in the README.

  Some of pymatgen's functionality is based on scientific advances /
  principles developed by the computational materials scientists in our
  team. Please refer to https://pymatgen.org on how to cite them.
type: software
